<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ColMut to distribute A$1.3 bln to members.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ColMut to distribute A$1.3 bln to members.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian life office Colonial Mutual said on Friday it planned to distribute A$1.3 billion in shares to its 538,000 members, and raise another A$550 million, as part of its demutualisation and listing.</p>
</text>
